# Line endings.
#
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"` and the repository stores LF.
# Without this file, a contributor whose git has `core.autocrlf=true` -- which is
# the Windows default -- checks out CRLF, and `npm run format:check` then fails
# on every file in the project. CI never sees it, because CI runs on Linux.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalises to LF on commit and checks out LF everywhere, so
# the working tree matches both what is stored and what Prettier expects.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must not touch.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webm  binary
*.mp4   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.zip   binary

